# CVE-2026-85091 (zlib 1.3.2-r0, no fixed package in Alpine v3.23 or edge).
# Not exploitable - heap buffer overflow in gz_vacate() on a stalled non-blocking
# gzwrite(), reachable only through zlib's gz* file-handle API. nginx compresses
# responses through the deflate stream API and never calls gzprintf()/gzvprintf();
# this image does not enable gzip at all.
# Remove this block once the base image ships a fixed zlib.
CVE-2026-85091
